@startuml
title ControlMaster, one authenticated transport serving many clients
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  BorderColor #2E8B67
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E8B67
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F7FBF9
  BorderColor #2E8B67
}

package "Local host" {
  [ssh #1\nmux master] as M
  [ControlPath socket\nSSH_CHANNEL_MUX_LISTENER] as SOCK
  [ssh #2\npassenger client] as C2
  [ssh #3\nproxy client] as C3
  [git / scp / rsync] as APP
}

package "Remote host" {
  [sshd] as S
}

M --> SOCK : listens
C2 --> SOCK : MUX_C_NEW_SESSION\n+ passed fds
C3 --> SOCK : MUX_C_PROXY
APP --> C2 : invokes
M --> S : one authenticated\nencrypted transport

note bottom of M
  Key exchange and authentication
  happen once, when the master
  starts. Later clients skip both.
end note

note bottom of C3
  Speaks SSH connection protocol,
  so it need not share this host.
end note
@enduml
